    {
      "index": 40,
      "tag": "h2",
      "attrs": {
        "id": "using-spreadsheet-data-in-guides"
      },
      "text": "Using Spreadsheet Data In Guides",
      "location": {
        "start": 167475,
        "end": 167565
      }
    },
    {
      "index": 41,
      "tag": "#text",
      "attrs": {},
      "text": "\n",
      "location": {
        "start": 167565,
        "end": 167566
      }
    },
    {
      "index": 42,
      "tag": "p",
      "attrs": {},
      "text": "⬥ Using data from the spreadsheet in a guide is very straightforward.",
      "location": {
        "start": 167566,
        "end": 167642
      }
    },
    {
      "index": 43,
      "tag": "#text",
      "attrs": {},
      "text": "\n",
      "location": {
        "start": 167642,
        "end": 167643
      }
    },
    {
      "index": 44,
      "tag": "p",
      "attrs": {},
      "text": "⬥ Values from the sheet can be accessed using the following command: data_pvme:<sheet>_<namedrange>, replacing the contents of <sheet> ‎and <namedrange> ‎with the sheet name and named range respectively.",
      "location": {
        "start": 167643,
        "end": 167950
      }
    },
    {
      "index": 45,
      "tag": "#text",
      "attrs": {},
      "text": "\n",
      "location": {
        "start": 167950,
        "end": 167951
      }
    },
    {
      "index": 46,
      "tag": "p",
      "attrs": {},
      "text": "⬥ When posted (by the PvME Bot), the command text will get replaced by the value present in that cell.",
      "location": {
        "start": 167951,
        "end": 168069
      }
    },
    {
      "index": 47,
      "tag": "#text",
      "attrs": {},
      "text": "\n",
      "location": {
        "start": 168069,
        "end": 168070
      }
    },
    {
      "index": 48,
      "tag": "p",
      "attrs": {},
      "text": "​",
      "location": {
        "start": 168070,
        "end": 168085
      }
    },
    {
      "index": 49,
      "tag": "#text",
      "attrs": {},
      "text": "\n",
      "location": {
        "start": 168085,
        "end": 168086
      }
    },
    {
      "index": 50,
      "tag": "p",
      "attrs": {},
      "text": "⬥ For example, the following sentence might be in a guide:",
      "location": {
        "start": 168086,
        "end": 168151
      }
    },
    {
      "index": 51,
      "tag": "#text",
      "attrs": {},
      "text": "\n",
      "location": {
        "start": 168151,
        "end": 168152
      }
    },
    {
      "index": 52,
      "tag": "pre",
      "attrs": {},
      "text": "Greater Chain <:gchain:1257440278512537740> is a very powerful ability, but is also quite expensive, costing <:coins:698816156961603654> $data_pvmе:unlock_gchain$.\n",
      "location": {
        "start": 168152,
        "end": 168352
      }
    },
    {
      "index": 53,
      "tag": "#text",
      "attrs": {},
      "text": "\n",
      "location": {
        "start": 168352,
        "end": 168353
      }
    },
    {
      "index": 54,
      "tag": "p",
      "attrs": {},
      "text": "⬥ When posted by the bot, it will look like the following:",
      "location": {
        "start": 168353,
        "end": 168418
      }
    },
    {
      "index": 55,
      "tag": "#text",
      "attrs": {},
      "text": "\n",
      "location": {
        "start": 168418,
        "end": 168419
      }
    },
    {
      "index": 56,
      "tag": "p",
      "attrs": {},
      "text": "\nNote: The command syntax can also be found in the Commands dropdown menu in the web guide editor tool.",
      "location": {
        "start": 168419,
        "end": 168620
      }
    },
    {
      "index": 57,
      "tag": "#text",
      "attrs": {},
      "text": "\n",
      "location": {
        "start": 168620,
        "end": 168621
      }
    },
    {
      "index": 58,
      "tag": "p",
